# How To Create A Simple Portfolio 

## 1. Introduction  

### What is a portfolio?

A Portfolio is a good platform to showcase a person's 
best work and achievements that prove their skills 
and experience.

### Who needs a Portfolio?

A portfolio is useful for any professional. It 
can be helpful for students, freelancers,job seekers 
who wants to show their skills and accomplishments.

## 2. Why does a beginner need a portfolio?

A portfolio can help beginners showcase their skills 
even if they do not have much past work experience.


